  "content": "\n\n<h1>細緻字型微調</h1>\n<p>你已經看膩了 Minecraft 預設字型，但又不想徹底更換嗎？本字型包對大家多年來熟悉的預設字型進行了小幅調整。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>置中大寫字母</strong>：讓大寫字母不再偏離中心。</li>\n<li><strong>圓潤縮小的小寫字母</strong>：小寫字母經過高度調整，並進行了細微優化。</li>\n<li><strong>細膩調整</strong>：☆ 其他小細節 ☆</li>\n</ul>\n<p>無論你是想輕微翻新視覺體驗，還是尋找全新風格，這款字型包都適合喜歡保留原版風味、享受細微改動的玩家。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/subtle-font-tweaks/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsubtle-font-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=1AD166\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
